// Lead-to-Revenue Capability Hierarchy + QTR Diagnostic Seed (Phase 1, 2026-08-09)
//
// Generated from two source workbooks Betsy supplied (not committed — original
// files stay in her Downloads folder): Lead_to_Revenue_Intelligence_V3_Full_
// Capability_Breakdown.xlsx (the 945-row, 4-level capability taxonomy) and
// QTR_Operational_Intelligence_OS_V5_Prepopulated.xlsx (the pre-built
// scenario/root-cause/impact/control/KPI/leakage/entity/AI-validation
// reference library). Loaded by server/db.js's bootstrap() into the existing
// Channel Journey substrate — see server/lib/l2rDiagnosticRegistry.js's header
// comment for the full reuse-first classification. Nothing here is a new
// table: capabilities and QTR reference facts become journey_metadata_
// molecules rows (Atoms, tagged by moleculeKind), sub-capabilities become
// journey_metadata_clusters rows, and QTR scenarios become journey_scenarios
// + journey_gate_definitions rows (one gate per Detection/Prevention/
// Escalation stage).
//
// This file is data only — no logic. See l2rDiagnosticRegistry.js for lookup
// helpers and server/db.js's bootstrap() for the idempotent seed-insert loop.

